{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "c8b497bb6200546d401edb0355fb3d95cfb7e5c6ac304160496cb970951263b5", "ja": "仲良しだけど……", "zh": "虽然是好朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7f0de9a2af2de39a2a963a7d74473cea762d3d52f5a2a5bb65efba66a6960563", "ja": "ハロウィン公演を目前に控え、\nオバケらしくなるためにレッスンを重ねる\nアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "万圣节公演的日子即将到来，\n这是偶像们为了能够表现得更贴近鬼怪，\n而不断进行训练的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "64656f5a530b6129aa32d22fbd0cdd1b687e9d546b958a595b99697b5af6a305", "ja": "（ハロウィン公演が決まった。テーマはヴァンパイア。\nそこで、育と桃子に重要な役を任せることにした）", "zh": "（已经确定要举办万圣节公演了，主题是吸血鬼。\n于是我把这重要的角色，交给了育和桃子负责。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "95b0c3a710390ab555a34106849736022db46fda483a12d32bb2812771ff9b47", "ja": "（が、ふたりは少々苦戦している様子……。今日の合同\nレッスンが、良い刺激になればと思っていたんだけど）", "zh": "（然而她们两人似乎有点陷入苦战……\n希望今天的共同训练课程，能带给她们正向刺激。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "c47d75c123d2a70ad39d439ae6e2a901b797a18581fb9886582cbbd31ddb8686", "ja": "ちょっと、遅いじゃない！　合同レッスンに\nプロデューサーが遅れるって、どういうことよ～！？", "zh": "真是的，你太慢了啦！\n制作人竟然在共同训练课程迟到，这到底是怎样～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "ec5b816bdf12e921e51fc91154e442ba05bc72882b8d5fe4d2dafdd65a992909", "ja": "あんたは一応、大人の責任者なんだから、\nしっかりしなさいよね！", "zh": "你好歹也是成年的负责人，\n麻烦你振作一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "88fbc6aaa47f0a44bf138552deddc6eadc27af08845135a7ed5b2fd78649b489", "ja": "ご、ごめん、伊織。育と桃子も。\n公演の打ち合わせが長引いてしまって……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉，伊织，还有育跟桃子也是。\n因为公演的会议时间耽搁到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "5bf062fd87773e5342fa043dc5e60d741daebfed1a918f0b4aa9aaab3e1c437d", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、時間厳守はプロの基本だよ？\n遅れる時は、せめて連絡くらい入れるのは常識でしょ！", "zh": "大哥哥，守时是专业人士的基本喔！\n有可能会迟到时，至少也该先联络一下，这是常识吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "f3027618fafb9e4ee12a8e7205801942dc218e3b073eb8583974cf439e50eb0d", "ja": "でも桃子ちゃん、車を運転中に電話するのは\n危ないからだめだって、おかあさんも言ってたよ。", "zh": "不过桃子，我妈妈说过开车时打电话很危险，\n所以不能这样做喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "82fc437427a7ff40487e11ec95e95db479b43817b087c188d0f5af1872b20510", "ja": "だからしょうがないよね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "所以你也是不得已的对吧，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "482121bc53a19f63489a46a0bd5f8886dec0593bb182b41abfea0d0bc447e96f", "ja": "あら、よかったじゃない♪", "zh": "哎呀，你得救了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "443ab585451ea54c8290aabe5cd2a89af5b8c3710694369647a379e34921db43", "ja": "本当にすみません……次から気をつけます……。\nそれで、今日の調子はどうだ？", "zh": "真的很不好意思……我下次会注意的……\n那么你们今天的状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f5a09efd1916392bd5fff792d8f63ab32e9d7110d1b2b3d8a73bf0e9300cdb1b", "ja": "うん……あのね、やっぱりこの前と\n同じところで失敗しちゃうみたい。", "zh": "嗯……那个呀，\n还是会在跟之前一样的地方出错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "904a290198be6b65a0442b58b3649f7717c242b7f1da1a6b34954f79f3310f9f", "ja": "全体的には悪くないって思うわ。でも、そうね……\n育のヴァンパイアは、ちょっと硬いかしら。", "zh": "我认为整体来看还不错，但是，我想想喔……\n育饰演的吸血鬼似乎有些生硬呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "40bd57b05d132354aa7496dd7c2e0ca3d29701377febb53b93641d75365bb668", "ja": "もっと柔らかく……朋花や莉緒みたいに、すこし\n妖艶って感じも出せると、良くなるんじゃない？", "zh": "要是能更柔和一点……像朋花和莉绪那样，\n稍微流露出一点妖艳的感觉，应该会更好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "28f20525e326d785f4b55efb4156087728c234d1c37fc1a7bc1271c6cebb105c", "ja": "朋花さんと莉緒さんみたいに……\nよーえんって、大人っぽいってこと？　桃子ちゃん。", "zh": "像朋花姊姊和莉绪姊姊那样……\n桃子，那个妖艳是成熟的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c76c12eca67e9730389d28d0684b9aa2d86ff3fba8fc625766be53b068e23c6", "ja": "大人っぽいのとは、ちょっとちがうかも。\nこの前見たアニメに、悪い魔法使いがいたでしょ？", "zh": "跟成熟或许有些差异呢。\n之前看过的动画里，不是有坏魔法使吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "4e91a4ddd4e1d28645411dfed1978e51518fd162307eeff5dc87bda4df635b4a", "ja": "たぶん、あんな感じだと思う。\nあやしくて、いい人か悪い人かわからない感じ。", "zh": "桃子觉得大概就是像那样，\n给人一种奇特、无法分辨是好人还是坏人的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "017e4982427e0e79d92e3f9940401505a9f4daddfbdce424b51b74ef1532c3aa", "ja": "「ふふっ、甘いわね……♪」\n……こんな感じかな？", "zh": "「呵呵，真是天真呢……♪」\n……应该就像这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "fd3474cc7f078869e249273fb834e11191a5cea74f66b07cfb70a827060e2290", "ja": "わあ……桃子ちゃん、すごい！\n悪い魔法使いに、そっくりだよ！", "zh": "哇……桃子你好厉害！\n演得跟坏魔法使一模一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "cda11a59e8d3144c9d3fe0e2e60e8318f1d8707a2b5d9d92fae84ae9b6018be6", "ja": "そっかー。\nよーし、わたしもやってみるね！", "zh": "这样啊～\n好～我也来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "862181059e995818de33fdb0b23f36692d2784719859e2365075b88c00841867", "ja": "それじゃ、もう一度最初から合わせてみましょうか？\n育、桃子、立ち位置に……。", "zh": "那么从头再配合一次看看吧？\n育、桃子，回到站位上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "e71ede9ea533023037658131a98eed5388f1db7040d30eb85c43d739b025a5bf", "ja": "ああーっ！　いおりーん発見！\nなになにー、こんなところでヒツマブシ？", "zh": "啊啊──！发现伊织儿了～！\n什么什么～你在这里「撒时间」吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "84e70f96cd9edd1155e67800733b2dcdd1db4159a2457d6576f13ebb99fd74b8", "ja": "みさきちが、いおりんのコト探してたよ？\nねえねえ、どんな落とし穴作ったの？", "zh": "美咲咲刚才在找伊织儿喔？\n欸欸，你做了怎样的地洞陷阱呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "6eeaae4d0484b9b3331c074a2f10b224e8e03c6b1de5e82a5c5d4e943661c517", "ja": "作ってないわよ！　さっき美咲に衣装のことで\n相談したから、きっとその話ね。", "zh": "才没做那种东西！我刚才找美咲讨论了关于服装的事，\n她一定是为了那件事才在找我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ab470e0057691456252b289db5333450dcb86aedba3b1173e6144505d18484d4", "ja": "亜美、真美、お疲れさま。\nこうして並んでみると……うん、壮観だな！", "zh": "亚美、真美，辛苦了。\n大家像这样站在一起……嗯，真是壮观呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "6ef9fbabdd17d0f839233a112a02975dbacac7b33234938203166b04081a00a0", "ja": "んっふっふっ～♪　気づいちゃったね、兄ちゃん。\nワレワレのせくしーへろもんが漏れていることに！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪大哥哥，\n你注意到我们散发出的性感费洛蒙了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "069a2f7ff2ff9d4ccf019feda06f56e9b61a28fa8c2f8b84729f3bc5567daad8", "ja": "ワレワレのモレモレのせくしーへろもんで、\n兄ちゃんをメロメロンビームのえじきに……。", "zh": "就用我们散发的性感费洛蒙，\n让大哥哥成为魅惑光线的牺牲者……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "9e07f39d5f15103b9897ec8060be4b35746917e80a2ddbce0ab4e412f869dab8", "ja": "それじゃ私は、美咲のところへ行ってくるわ。\n{$P$}、ふたりをお願いね。", "zh": "那我先去美咲那里一趟了。\n{$P$}，她们两人就麻烦你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "a744940f5afe11107cd16ad35cb7fb7fad7259df18d6f521e7d610a98c5e1589", "ja": "亜美、真美。ジャマする気なら、\nあんたたちも一緒に来なさいっ！", "zh": "亚美、真美，如果你们打算捣乱，\n就跟我一起过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "8cf68dcd3b9c98bdcba4cef7ff50ab11f687126e8a989eb160105eeefb98641d", "ja": "ええ！？　待ってよ、いおりん！\n今、メロメロンビームの準備をしてるとこなのに～！", "zh": "咦咦！？等一下啦，伊织儿！\n现在才正在准备魅惑光线的说～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "ca3ec37c7cf8bd86261946a03f94d2b0d82b90b5080943d102a353d0c881d857", "ja": "うあうあ～！\n亜美は、準備もさせてもらえなかったよ～！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～！\n亚美连准备都还没开始啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "bd07e957567c084e9d766322ea8e7172aa0071221925b9309f4283b1749fd556", "ja": "ああ、もう行っちゃったか……慌ただしいな。\nそれじゃ育、桃子、レッスンの続きをしようか。", "zh": "唉唉，已经走掉了吗……真是来去一阵风啊。\n那么育、桃子，我们继续进行训练课程吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "1f964273ebafbbd769b4fe3559f324d60f6e33fd78412514b6e5c67e437f68c5", "ja": "うん！　桃子ちゃん、\nもう一回はじめからやってみてもいい？", "zh": "嗯！桃子，\n可以从头再来一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "badf57127ed8eb64db5231341c6edfd5df4b386da458476ad1fc753ecdecbfaf", "ja": "うん。桃子もそのつもりだったし。\nお兄ちゃんはそこで、ちゃんと見ててね。わかった？", "zh": "嗯，桃子也是这么打算的。\n大哥哥要在那边好好看着喔，知道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "2c6c2a5b73da8e88f6545095d46a6d11dd01f8e296233354b0019d82a9da189e", "ja": "うーん、おかしいなぁ。また同じところで\n失敗しちゃう……えっと、もう一回！", "zh": "嗯～太奇怪了，又在同样的地方出错……\n呃，再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "d9157cd8f4ce6bccdbb8a128fa801a0d754f2a0c067144d7df3116a23c8324e6", "ja": "ちょっと待って、育。\nその前に……深呼吸してみて。", "zh": "育，稍等一下。\n在那之前……你先试着深呼吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "89058377de3bff7724874e049b92f8e7a1b4671d0c409631b5fe6b24ad9c7ef4", "ja": "しんこきゅう？　う、うん、わかった。\n……すぅ～、はぁ～。すぅ～、はぁ～。", "zh": "深呼吸？嗯、嗯，我知道了。\n……（吸气～吐气～吸气～吐气～）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff5aa7ea136d20ba7242f37fdd3a34d0cebf9a9bd4a99f6163664436f375340b", "ja": "あれ……？\nなんだかちょっと、体が軽くなった気がする……。", "zh": "咦……？\n总觉得身体稍微变得比较轻盈了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8b5c8b79144620ed7256fb26f785bb0c37ed5c77e7bfd1082efff31a07d61d9", "ja": "緊張してると、肩とかいろんなところに力が\n入りすぎて、思うように動けなくなるでしょ。", "zh": "只要觉得紧张，肩膀等不少的部位都会太过用力，\n变得无法随心所欲活动对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "eb9106f18e4683597c7172d47e5a5e8f525de20e4088f6bb0566ee049f2c05ca", "ja": "だから緊張したら、深呼吸するといいと思う。\n本番まで、まだ日にちもあるし。", "zh": "所以感到紧张时，就试着深呼吸会比较好。\n而且距离正式演出还有好几天嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ca45d5d4e749a301c28ecc14f8323e5d7185062f579516a9ce5f2f76b696a58d", "ja": "そうだな。育、レッスンの時間はまだまだあるんだ。\n焦らなくていいから、思いきってやってみよう！", "zh": "就是说啊，育，还有很多时间能训练。\n不用太焦急，尽你所能去尝试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "63508123f553faf17e871ba77980d3d285e441ba12c910bd51315755537c45ba", "ja": "{$P$}さん、桃子ちゃん……\nありがとう！　わたし、やってみるね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、桃子……\n谢谢你们！我会试试看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "f23fadecca88d0e38fd8c2d3984b748a0a1e029f0f00e0cb2565ba40a1ae8ac2", "ja": "も、桃子はプロだし、これくらいのアドバイス、\nできて当たり前だよ。それに……。", "zh": "桃、桃子可是专业的，\n当然有能耐给出这点程度的建言，再说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "683db399c512fd37b8addeecd6ff3367b06b2f98025d46a82f7dd1f71d59a68a", "ja": "育はいつも、その……一生懸命だから。\n見てると、桃子もがんばろうって思うし……。", "zh": "育一直都，呃……非常努力。\n看到这样的你，桃子也觉得要加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c8eeabf3124c2b9cee951ff0b5bbe351164b3824583dac4d5415dce2c76e317", "ja": "えへへ、うれしい！\nいっしょにがんばろうね、桃子ちゃん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我好高兴！\n我们一起努力吧，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "ab292e7bdb87661858ff6cd8e992068576f3e1186cb4464ab28bd176332ced15", "ja": "うん！　桃子だって、育に負けないよ！", "zh": "嗯！桃子也不会输给你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "ffc70731c09167b46417bfc48ab43ef76f4522a6046ee8b593b3e68ff54a8be2", "ja": "そうか。ふたりは仲良しだけど、\n身近なライバルでもあるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，你们两人虽然是好朋友，\n但同时也是近在身边的劲敌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "96636ce73e4fb42a7ef47b4609de5997a7e09a2768630b20a43ce437755ae418", "ja": "ライバルかぁ……ライバルって、なんかカッコイイね♪\nわたしも、桃子ちゃんに負けないようにがんばる！", "zh": "劲敌啊……劲敌听起来很帅呢♪\n我也会努力不输给桃子的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_020_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_020_fc_01_1048_049mom", "source_sha256": "d5ff180e1e8502a51aa5ed7d4cee06eae880bee598e8f5c73cf60fc824e89a91", "ja": "桃子たちがいれば、公演の成功は間違いなしだしね。\nお兄ちゃん、サポートよろしくね♪", "zh": "只要有桃子我们在，公演肯定会成功。\n大哥哥，就麻烦你支援啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
